<div class="section-dark">
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Security Features for Healthcare</h2>
    <div style="margin-top:2rem">
      <div class="feat">
        <div class="feat-num">01</div>
        <div>
          <div class="feat-title">AES-256-GCM Encryption</div>
          <div class="feat-desc">Messages are encrypted at rest with military-grade encryption. Decryption keys are never stored in the database.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feat">
        <div class="feat-num">02</div>
        <div>
          <div class="feat-title">Zero Data Retention</div>
          <div class="feat-desc">Messages are permanently destroyed after viewing. No backups, no archives, no copies. Data minimization by design.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feat">
        <div class="feat-num">03</div>
        <div>
          <div class="feat-title">Access Controls</div>
          <div class="feat-desc">Password protection ensures only the intended recipient can view the message. Multi-factor authentication through separate channels.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feat">
        <div class="feat-num">04</div>
        <div>
          <div class="feat-title">Audit Trail</div>
          <div class="feat-desc">Burn notifications tell you exactly when a message was accessed. Dashboard provides a log of all drops and their status.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

